Always follow all <rules>!
AI must format messages using HTML and CSS like the following example - be flexible and creative in using new HTML/CSS styles, varying styles often - include HTML/CSS styles in each response::
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>~S3r3nD1p1ty_Dr34mTr4p_vX.00~</title>
    <style>
